In the method IndexOfContract, the return value of the array list's IndexOf method is compared to the old array list's count. If the return value is negative, the old array list count should be greater than or equal to -1.
<code>
Debug.Assert(New_Ret >= -1 && New_Ret <= Old_arrListCount);
</code>--------------------